# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions for the latest version of Operator backpropagation (OBP)"
msgstr "연산자 역전파(OBP) 최신 버전 설치 안내"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions"
msgstr "설치 안내"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions {#installation-instructions}"
msgstr "설치 안내 {#installation-instructions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before installing the package, choose how you’re going to run and install the packages. There are two primary ways to do this:\n"
msgstr "패키지를 설치하기 전에 패키지를 실행하고 설치할 방법을 선택하세요. 주된 방법은 두 가지입니다.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Option 1: Install from PyPI](#option-1)\n"
msgstr "[옵션 1: PyPI에서 설치](#option-1)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Option 2: Install from source](#option-2)\n"
msgstr "[옵션 2: 소스에서 설치](#option-2)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Preinstallation {#preinstallation}"
msgstr "사전 설치 {#preinstallation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it. We recommend using [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3.10/tutorial/venv.html).\n"
msgstr "먼저 Python만 설치된 최소한의 환경을 만드세요. [Python 가상 환경](https://docs.python.org/3.10/tutorial/venv.html)을 사용하는 것을 권장합니다.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "새 환경을 활성화하세요.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Note: If you are using Windows, use the following commands in PowerShell:\n"
msgstr "참고: Windows를 사용하는 경우 PowerShell에서 다음 명령을 사용하세요.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"option-1\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option 1: Install from PyPI {#option-1-install-from-pypi}"
msgstr "옵션 1: PyPI에서 설치 {#option-1-install-from-pypi}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The most straightforward way to install the `qiskit-addon-obp` package is by using `PyPI`.\n"
msgstr "`qiskit-addon-obp` 패키지를 설치하는 가장 간단한 방법은 `PyPI`를 사용하는 것입니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"option-2\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option 2: Install from source {#option-2-install-from-source}"
msgstr "옵션 2: 소스에서 설치 {#option-2-install-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Users who want to develop in the repository or run the notebooks locally might want to install from source.\n"
msgstr "저장소에서 직접 개발하거나 노트북을 로컬에서 실행하려는 사용자는 소스에서 설치하는 것이 좋을 수 있습니다.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If so, the first step is to clone the `qiskit-addon-obp` repository.\n"
msgstr "그렇다면 첫 단계는 `qiskit-addon-obp` 저장소를 복제(clone)하는 것입니다.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, upgrade pip and enter the repository.\n"
msgstr "다음으로 pip를 업그레이드하고 저장소로 이동하세요.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The next step is to install `qiskit-addon-obp` to the virtual environment. If you plan on running the notebooks, install the notebook dependencies so you can run visualizations. If you plan on developing in the repository, you might want to install the `dev` dependencies.\n"
msgstr "다음 단계는 가상 환경에 `qiskit-addon-obp`를 설치하는 것입니다. 노트북을 실행할 계획이라면 시각화를 실행할 수 있도록 노트북 종속성을 설치하세요. 저장소에서 개발할 계획이라면 `dev` 종속성을 설치하는 것이 좋습니다.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust the options below to suit your needs.\n"
msgstr "아래 옵션을 필요에 맞게 조정하세요.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you installed the notebook dependencies, you can get started by running the notebooks in the docs directory.\n"
msgstr "노트북 종속성을 설치했다면 docs 디렉터리의 노트북을 실행하여 시작할 수 있습니다.\n"
